title: ScientistPhone
---
<<once>>
    <<declare $seventhwave = false>>
    Scientist: Baker, it’s me! #line:S7-01-scientist
    Scientist: The military doesn’t want the people to know. #line:S7-02-scientist
    Scientist: That the government is responsible for this outbreak! #line:S7-03-scientist
    Scientist: We were trying to do good! #line:S7-04-scientist
    Scientist: But they rushed the project and started testing on people to soon! #line:S7-05-scientist
    Scientist: The formula is very unstable. #line:S7-06-scientist
    Scientist: That’s why It keeps changing and adapting! #line:S7-07-scientist
    Scientist: The smaller infected are faster to avoid attacks! #line:S7-08-scientist

    <<spawn_new_recipe "scientist">>  
    Scientist: I will give you another recipe to help you with this. #line:S7-09-scientist
    Scientist: That will make them slow down! #line:S7-10-scientist
    Scientist: I have to go! #line:S7-11-scientist
    Scientist: Remember! #line:S7-12-scientist
    Scientist: Only one phone works at the time. #line:S7-13-scientist
    Scientist: So you can only talk to one of us from now on! #line:S7-14-scientist
    <<hang_up "scientist">>
<<else>>
    <<if !$seventhwave>>
        <<jump SeventhWave_Scientist>>
    <<endif>>
<<endonce>>
===

title: SeventhWave_Scientist
---
<<set $seventhwave = true>>
Scientist: Glad you made the right choice. #line:S8-01-scientist
Scientist: Now, focus! #line:S8-02-scientist
Scientist: There are hoards coming your way with a variety of mutations. #line:S8-03-scientist
<<spawn_new_recipe "scientist">>
Scientist: We developed another recipe to help you out. #line:S8-04-scientist
Scientist: A donut that grows and takes them out in line! #line:S8-05-scientist
Scientist: Also, we gave you a second pastry bag. #line:S8-06-scientist
<<spawn_pastry_bag>>
Scientist: As we need to use everything we have! #line:S8-07-scientist
Scientist: They are weak to the gluten in your recipes due to the origin of the outbreak! #line:S8-08-scientist
Scientist: We were trying to find a cure for gluten intolerance. #line:S8-09-scientist
Scientist: But the idea of baking a fortune our of it. #line:S8-10-scientist
Scientist: Made the government push for human testing way to soon. #line:S8-11-scientist
Scientist: The patient escaped somehow and started the outbreak. #line:S8-12-scientist
Scientist: And now we have to pick up the pieces. #line:S8-13-scientist
<<hang_up "scientist">>
<<start_wave>>
===

title: MilitarPhone
---
Military: Good choice soldier! #line:S8-01-military
Military: Now let’s get serious! #line:S8-02-military
Military: As our radars see. #line:S8-03-military
Military: Packs of them coming. #line:S8-04-military
Military: The stronger, smarter and faster. #line:S8-05-military
Military: Are more common than the original ones. #line:S8-06-military
Military: You will need to fill your arsenal. #line:S8-07-military
Military: We scattered explosive barrels in your area. #line:S8-08-military
Military: Use them to your advantage. #line:S8-09-military
<<spawn_barrels>>
<<spawn_new_recipe "military">>
Military: There is also a new recipe. #line:S8-10-military
Military: That those nerds left behind. #line:S8-11-military
Military: Before isolating themselves to their ratholes. #line:S8-12-military
Military: They are to focus on finding a cure. #line:S8-13-military
Military: Fighting against us. #line:S8-14-military
Military: While the superior pressure us. #line:S8-15-military
Military: So this doesn’t get of control. #line:S8-16-military
Military: We already failed once by letting the patience 0 escape. #line:S8-17-military
Military: We cannot make more mistakes! #line:S8-18-military
<<hang_up "military">>
<<start_wave>>
===